Original work
-------------

The following are original to this repository:

  mods/herdr-dock/        the sidebar dock: theme, plan usage, notes
  mods/herdr-look/        the per-space icon and colour dialog
  mods/herdr-notes/       the notes and to-do dialog
  mods/herdr-panel/       the theme and plan-usage popup
  mods/pungitore-panel/   the right-hand panel that mirrors each repository's TODO.md

  layouts/herdr.json      the personal layout
  themes/tron-blue.json   the Tron blue theme
  themes/tron-orange.json the Tron orange theme
  keys.json               the key bindings
  settings.json           the personal settings
  README.md, .gitignore

Derived work
------------

The following mods are modified copies of mods shipped with Herdr, version
0.1.16, from https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. They are listed in each mod's `mod.json` under
`cloned_from`, naming the shipped mod and the version it was taken from:

  mods/herdr-agents/  <- mods/agents   (0.1.16)
  mods/herdr-menu/    <- mods/menu     (0.1.16)
  mods/herdr-pane/    <- mods/pane     (0.1.16)
  mods/herdr-spaces/  <- mods/spaces   (0.1.16)
  mods/herdr-tabs/    <- mods/tabs     (0.1.16)

The SVG files under `mods/herdr-pane/` (`close.svg`, `split-down.svg`,
`split-right.svg`, `unzoom.svg`, `zoom.svg`) and `mods/herdr-tabs/`
(`win-close.svg`, `win-max.svg`, `win-min.svg`, `win-restore.svg`) are
unchanged copies of the art shipped with the mods named above.
